          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "outer",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " court, toward the north, and he brought me to the chambers which were opposite the temple yard and opposite the building on the north. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The length of the building which was on the north side",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "door",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " was",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "before the length",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " a hundred cubits, and the breadth fifty cubits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adjoining the twenty cubits which belonged to the inner court, and facing the pavement which belonged to the outer court, was gallery",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The meaning of the Hebrew word is unknown",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " against gallery",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The meaning of the Hebrew word is unknown",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in three stories. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And before the chambers was a passage inward, ten cubits wide and a hundred cubits long,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "a way of one cubit",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and their doors were on the north. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the upper chambers were narrower, for the galleries",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The meaning of the Hebrew word is unknown",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " took more away from them than from the lower and middle chambers in the building. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they were in three stories, and they had no pillars like the pillars of the outer",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb lacks",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "outer",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " court; hence the upper chambers were set back from the ground more than the lower and the middle ones. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there was a wall outside parallel to the chambers, toward the outer court, opposite the chambers, fifty cubits long. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the chambers on the outer court were fifty cubits long, while those opposite the temple were a hundred cubits long. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Below these chambers was an entrance on the east side, as one enters them from the outer court, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "where the outside wall begins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn Compare Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "in the breadth of the wall of the court",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
